course: dictionary
lesson: 12478
title: Feeling let down: dejected
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Dejected is a feeling word. It describes someone who is sad and has lost hope, usually after something goes wrong or does not work out.
explain: «The team lost the final, and the players walked off the pitch dejected.» The clue is lost the final. A loss is a disappointment, so dejected must mean sad and let down.
explain: Writers also show dejected through the body: shoulders drooping, head hanging, eyes on the ground. When you spot these clues, you can work out the feeling even if you have never met the word before.
fact: Dejected is an adjective, so it describes a person: a dejected player.
fact: The other forms are more dejected and most dejected.
fact: «Dejected» means sad and without hope, often after a failure or a disappointment.
fact: In stories, «Mole felt dejected when he could not visit his old home.»
fact: Sports reports often describe the losing team as dejected.
exercise: «The players were dejected after the final.» What does dejected mean? | *Sad and without hope | Proud of winning | Very tired from running | Excited and full of energy
exercise: Copy the word that names the feeling. «Mia's shoulders drooped, and she looked dejected after missing the goal.» | after | Mia | *dejected | goal
exercise: Which sentence shows someone feeling dejected? | Sara ran to the shop to buy a drink | *Tom sat alone on the step, head hanging, after his team lost | The dog barked happily at the postman | The baby giggled at the bubbles
test: «After the storm washed away their picnic, the family felt ___.» Which word fits the gap? | Thrilled | *Dejected | Sleepy | Hungry
test: «Mole was dejected when he could not visit his old home.» What does dejected mean here? | Excited to go out | Calm and sleepy | *Sad and without hope | Angry and loud
exam: Which sentence uses dejected correctly? | *After the match, the losing captain looked dejected | Dejected, the sun was shining brightly | The dejected puppy wagged its tail and jumped for joy | The dejected ran fast and won the race
